Scope

The MIT licence above applies to the code of this repository except third-party
code, which is not licensed by the authors and keeps the licence of its source:
  - everything under vendor/;
  - files that copy or adapt third-party code:
      src/st12c/rhythmformer_author/post_process.py (RhythmFormer authors,
        from rPPG-Toolbox),
      src/st12c/rhythm_loss_author.py (RhythmFormer authors, adapted from
        PhysFormer and HR-CNN),
      src/st30r/author_augmentation.py (RhythmFormer authors, commit 7c9cea2),
      src/st9g/preprocess.py (rPPG-Toolbox, BaseLoader transforms),
      src/eval/har.py (derived from rPPG-Toolbox evaluation/post_process.py),
      src/st3/readers.py (POS and CHROM as in rPPG-Toolbox,
        unsupervised_methods/methods/POS_WANG.py and CHROME_DEHAAN.py),
      train/mcc_loss.py (Toyota Research Institute, RemotePPG; its MIT notice
        is reproduced in the file),
      tools/mcc_unit_test.py (its reference copy of the RemotePPG author code
        of train/mcc_loss.py; the rest of the file is under the MIT licence
        above);
  - any other code taken from a third party.

The aggregate results (results/) and the documents (docs/, README.md and the
other text files) are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The datasets used in this study are not part of this repository; they are
